'''PETA Enthusiast''' is an [[Achievement]] awarded for removing the aggro of an opponent.

{{Quote|New achievement! PETA Enthusiast!

You somehow managed to remove the hostility of an aggravated, non-sapient enemy. That enemy then fought against other enemies to your benefit. The ghost of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steve_Irwin Steve Irwin] smiles down upon you.

Reward: The ghost of Steve Irwin smiles upon you|author=[[System AI]]}}

